{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/65210292163c1b1fc447e170b7975225.poster.avif?t=1657192542\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/65210292163c1b1fc447e170b7975225.webm?t=1657192542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/65210292163c1b1fc447e170b7975225.mp4?t=1657192542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>VAR: Exterminate; Zombie rough-lite shooter that promises raw exhilarating horror with vast replayability. Designed exclusively for VR, immerse yourself in a post-apocalyptic city overrun by zombies<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dictate your outcome</h2>Pick one of the 3 abilities offered to you at the beginning of every wave! Form your own ability tree and take on waves of relentless zombie attacks. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/0793721e9bd440461f2d3e22bb98b509.avif?t=1657192542\" width=550 height=172 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive zombie survival</h2>Eliminate zombies crawling all over the city, loot the undead to get money and chips to upgrade your weapons and equipment.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/a45ec88017d1e9ae2639f5e7331abf76.avif?t=1657192542\" width=550 height=136 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich and high-quality game content</h2>There are 12 stages built for 2 Chapters. More will be added over time for free, so check back for more maps, stages, and chapters later.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/d908888ef2f6dd0a23a54107304d551a.avif?t=1657192542\" width=550 height=208 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick your style</h2> Whether you\u2019re a gunslinging cowboy or a grenade launching trooper. Exterminate offers an array of weapons for you to take the undead out in style.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Global Ranking</h2> Have what it takes to be a top dog? Challenge yourself against players over the world and fight out if you really have what it takes to be the toughest mercenary in the field!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Only in VR</h2>VAR: Exterminate is a zombie shooter built exclusively for VR. Step into the midst of a zombie apocalypse and join the fight to take back what is rightfully ours!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Complete Escape From Longfeng City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578960/76173e8fab86100469cc788b7cda87ecc4184631.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Head For North Dilig","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578960/2b8a295f5829bdcf04cf7a23cdd040df9d161e00.jpg"},{"name":"Proof Of Honor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578960/c410c7b07e4f9949d1a2a9aed1a7a845c813713c.jpg"},{"name":"If You Can't Beat Them, Join Them","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578960/fa7fafb8c0f4dfef0a5491c028c93848350d6fb8.jpg"},{"name":"Moneymaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578960/b37ca398bb04e246e801073403ba711cefb8aae2.jpg"},{"name":"No Mercy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578960/6d65376724100b291abb25fb44514bf842978345.jpg"},{"name":"Combo Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578960/dcde5ac5dac2100d402849ee7db323d0f5239f79.jpg"},{"name":"I Am Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1578960/55e4117f0f9512b06a423c6b32